index 7765fed..8f87e36 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -56,6 +56,16 @@ Database-backed job queue (no Redis):
 
 Recurring tasks are declared in `config/recurring.yml`.
 
+### Storage Usage
+
+`Account#bytes_used` and `Board#bytes_used` report how much storage an account or
+a board uses: card images and the files embedded in board descriptions, card
+descriptions, and comments. Totals live in columns and are recalculated in the
+background (`RecalculateBytesUsedJob`); a change to a counted file marks the
+record stale, and `RecalculateStaleBytesUsedJob` sweeps up whatever was marked but
+never recalculated, including records that predate the tracking.
+
+
 ### Sharded Full-Text Search
 
 Full-text search runs in the database, not Elasticsearch. On MySQL it is sharded 16 ways by CRC32 of the account ID (`Search::Record::Trilogy`); on SQLite it is a single FTS5 index (`Search::Record::SQLite`). Don't assume the sharded shape when working under SQLite. Models in `app/models/search/`.
